  "notes": "FORMS:\n{補|ほ} (supplement, compensate) + ⟦{足|そく}→足：00992_soku⟧ (add, suffice) → add to supplement\n{補足|ほそく}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to supplement, to add)\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- {補足|ほそく}⟦{説明|せつめい}→説明：01449_setsumei⟧ (supplementary explanation)\n- {補足|ほそく}⟦{情報|じょうほう}→情報：03348_jouhou⟧ (supplementary information)\n- {補足|ほそく}⟦{資料|しりょう}→資料：04166_shiryou⟧ (supplementary materials)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{追加|ついか}→追加：04060_tsuika⟧ (addition)\n- ⟦{付|つ}け{足|た}す→付け足す：06863_tsuketasu⟧ (to add on)\n- ⟦{補|おぎな}う→補う：00329_oginau⟧ (to supplement, to make up for)\n- ⟦{添|そ}える→添える：13315_soeru⟧ (to add, to attach)\n\nUSAGE:\nCommonly used in meetings, presentations, and written documents when adding clarifying information. The phrase \"⟦{一点|いってん}→一点：08894_itten⟧{補足|ほそく}です⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧\" (Just one thing to add...) is frequently heard in business settings.",
